\* All TLC check configs for AntflyDocumentIdentity.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyDocumentIdentity.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyReuseOrdinal = FALSE
    BuggyAcceptStaleFilter = FALSE
    BuggyAcceptNamespaceMismatch = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    AllocatedOrdinalsHaveStableOwner
    LiveDocsHaveVisibleOrdinals
    NoTwoLiveDocsShareOrdinal
    TombstoneHidesCurrentGeneration
    ResolvedFilterMatchesCurrentContext
    CanonicalRowsMatchStoredNamespace
    StrictOpenRejectsNamespaceMismatch
    Safety

==== BadNamespaceMismatch
\* Expected-failure config: strict open accepts a configured namespace that does
\* not match the stored identity namespace.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyReuseOrdinal = FALSE
    BuggyAcceptStaleFilter = FALSE
    BuggyAcceptNamespaceMismatch = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    StrictOpenRejectsNamespaceMismatch
    Safety

==== BadReuseOrdinal
\* Expected-failure config: reusing a tombstoned ordinal for another document
\* breaks stable ordinal ownership.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyReuseOrdinal = TRUE
    BuggyAcceptStaleFilter = FALSE
    BuggyAcceptNamespaceMismatch = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    AllocatedOrdinalsHaveStableOwner
    Safety

==== BadStaleFilter
\* Expected-failure config: accepting a resolved-doc-filter built for an old
\* identity generation lets stale filter context constrain current search.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyReuseOrdinal = FALSE
    BuggyAcceptStaleFilter = TRUE
    BuggyAcceptNamespaceMismatch = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    ResolvedFilterMatchesCurrentContext
    Safety
